# DDMT for Image Classification

This repository provides the implementation of DDImage<sub>DDMT</sub> applied to image classification tasks.

## Implementation

The main implementation and model definitions are organized in the following files:

- `DDImage_DDMT.py`: implementation of DDMT for image classification, code for MR and three models (mobilenet, resnet, and vgg)
- `mobilenet_ddmt.py`: interface for debugging mobilenet
- `resnet_ddmt.py`: interface for debugging resnet
- `vgg_ddmt.py`: interface for debugging vgg

## How to Apply

Run the corresponding script directly for each backbone:

```bash
python mobilenet_ddmt.py
python resnet_ddmt.py
python vgg_ddmt.py
